<title>MALAYSIA: Berjaya Leisure six-mth net up 176.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Berjaya Leisure six-mth net up 176.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Oct 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  36.04	vs	 13.03</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  7.70	vs	  2.90</p>
<p>    Turnover		  1,113.55     vs    1,071.86</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    133.64     vs	 72.49</p>
<p>    Minorities less	    47.85     vs  less 31.07</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	     9.52     vs	 77.37</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)	  6.0	vs	  3.5</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Berjaya Leisure Bhd. Its businesses include operating hotels, resorts and gaming.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
